---
description: Shared Aavedak project instructions
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository instructions in `AGENTS.md` (the single shared source; Claude reads it via `CLAUDE.md`). Read and apply them before making changes.

**Never push to GitHub or any remote** (`git push` in any form). Commits stay local; the user pushes.

Area docs load on demand through glob-scoped rules in this folder:

- `web-app.mdc` → `apps/web/WEB.md` (pages, API resources, ATS score sources, limits)
- `ats-engines.mdc` → `apps/api/app/ats/ENGINES.md`
- `discovery.mdc` → `apps/api/app/discovery/DISCOVERY.md`

Keep those docs and `AGENTS.md` accurate when you change an area; don't duplicate their content here.
